<title>CANADA: Canada Nov advance Raw Materials Price Index falls.</title>
<headline>Canada Nov advance Raw Materials Price Index falls.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index is for a 2.2 percent fall in November from October, Statistics Canada said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			  Nov</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 -6.5</p>
<p>    Metals			  +1.4</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	-1.4</p>
<p>    Wood			    +0.8</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    -0.2</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
